<h2>With thanks</h2>

<p>The Mandan Historical Society gratefully recognizes Kathy Spilman, former website administrator and writer. Her care, research, and writing underlies most of the content on this website.</p>

<h2>Help preserve local history</h2>

<p>Do you have a story, photograph, document, correction, or idea to share? We welcome suggestions for this site and contributions that can help preserve Mandan's heritage for future generations.</p>

<p>Whether you can identify people or places in a photograph, share a family memory, recommend a topic, volunteer your time, or support the Society's work, your involvement matters. Please <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">contact the Mandan Historical Society</a> to start a conversation.</p>
